        <div style="text-align: left;" class="slideTextFrame"><font style="color: white; display: inline; font-family: '\'Times New Roman\'', Times, serif; font-size: 1pt;">&#160;Disclaimers&#160;&#160;Important Information About Littelfuse, Inc. This presentation does
