            ROIC&#160;&#160;Estimated margin expansion across Electronics, Transportation, and Industrial segments&#160;&#160;2030 Target: 24% &#8211; 26% Adj. EBITDA Margin1&#160;&#160;DRIVERS AND ASSUMPTIONS&#160;&#160;$0.5B&#160;&#160;~$50M&#160;&#160;~$200M&#160;&#160;~$400M&#160;&#160;Note: see Appendix for reconciliation of non-GAAP
            figures. 1 Company estimate.&#160;&#160;1&#160;</font></div>
