            Business Unit. He then held various positions of increasing responsibility at Littelfuse including Vice President, Global Sales, Electronics Business Unit; Senior Vice President, Electronics Business Unit from 2011 until 2019; and Senior Vice
            President and General Manager, Electronics and Industrial Business from 2019 until assuming his current position in 2022.&#160;&#160;DEEPAK NAYARSenior Vice President and General Manager, CCDI Market&#160;</font></div>
